Everything under this directory comes from OpenCelliD (https://opencellid.org),
run by Unwired Labs, and its contributors.

OpenCelliD's attribution page (https://docs.opencellid.org/docs/attribution,
read on 2026-10-06) says: "OpenCellID data is licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0,
including API results, dataset downloads and daily changes." It asks to
"credit OpenCelliD, link to the source and license, and indicate any
changes", and gives this credit for print or plain text:

  Cell tower data from OpenCellID (https://opencellid.org),
  licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/).

When sharing adapted material, follow the licence's ShareAlike terms,
retain the supplied copyright, licence and warranty notices, and do not
restrict recipients' licensed rights. Exceptions to the attribution
requirement are granted only in writing by Unwired Labs.

This dataset is not made or endorsed by OpenCelliD or Unwired Labs.

The files under raw/<date>/ are OpenCelliD's own, byte for byte; each
snapshot's MANIFEST.json records their URLs (without the access token),
sizes, sha256 and Last-Modified.

Changes: the GeoParquet under parquet/<date>/ was made from
raw/<date>/cell_towers.csv.gz:

  - columns typed by name (radio as text; cell, created and updated as
    64-bit integers; lon and lat as floating-point numbers; the others as
    32-bit integers)
  - a geometry column added: the point (lon, lat) of each row, WKB with
    GeoParquet metadata (OGC:CRS84)
  - all 14 columns and every row kept in the CSV's order
  - no value was changed

The code that fetches, checks and converts is in the repository this
dataset was built from (MIT) and does not apply here.
